From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joan Karadimov <joan.karadimov@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:48:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Include errno.h where WinNTFileSystem sets ENOMEM

It reached the file through other headers with gcc, not with clang.

Upstream: not submitted; OpenJDK itself only builds Windows with Visual Studio
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/java.base/windows/native/libjava/WinNTFileSystem_md.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/java.base/windows/native/libjava/WinNTFileSystem_md.c b/src/java.base/windows/native/libjava/WinNTFileSystem_md.c
index 2834a4495..5103658c9 100644
--- a/src/java.base/windows/native/libjava/WinNTFileSystem_md.c
+++ b/src/java.base/windows/native/libjava/WinNTFileSystem_md.c
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <ctype.h>
 #include <direct.h>
+#include <errno.h>
 #include <windows.h>
 #include <io.h>
 #include <limits.h>
